silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_07_sections_03_concrete_anchor_1#lifecyclephaseadult silm:hasLongDescription "The LifecyclePhaseAdult is the 'adult' lifecycle phase as one example phase. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'phi', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
